Andrewnt219" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Andrewnt219</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5632" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5632</a> chore: prepare Algolia migration (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5628" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5628</a> chore: fix warning after build (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5573" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5573</a> misc: fix ungrammatical sentence about 5-min tutorial (<a href="https://github.com/hughlilly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@hughlilly</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5499" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5499</a> chore: set up CodeQL (<a href="https://github.com/zpao" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@zpao</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5474" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5474</a> chore: remove beta.4 docs (already archived) (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-init</code>, <code>docusaurus-preset-bootstrap</code>, <code>docusaurus-theme-bootstrap</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/5634" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#5634</a> chore: remove unused Bootstrap theme (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-i